00:09:43,636 --> 00:09:49,636
The Boss Baby: Family Business is a animation, comedy,
adventure film directed by Tom McGrath.

3
00:14:35,454 --> 00:14:41,454
The Templeton brothers — Tim and his Boss Baby little bro Ted —
have become adults and drifted away from each other.

4
00:19:27,272 --> 00:19:33,272
But a new boss baby with a cutting-edge approach and a can-do attitude is about
to bring them together again … and inspire a new family business.

5
00:24:19,090 --> 00:24:25,090
Theodore Templeton (voice), played by Alec Baldwin.

6
00:29:10,909 --> 00:29:16,909
Tim Templeton (voice), played by James Marsden.

7
